{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "谢灵试图拉拢布小谷  (Xie Ling Tries to Win Over Bu Xiaogu)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xie_ling": "谢灵",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Walking calmly into the chief editor's office on her own, Bu Xiaogu introduces herself to Xie Ling to find out what he intends to do with Xingtian's delayed travel show. Listen to their Mandarin exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢总，刚才没来得及认识，我叫布小谷，是总编室高级制作人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "好长的名头啊，找我有事啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想听一听您对节目魅力远航的看法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "这个节目我大致了解，我的态度就是先放到一边，暂且不管吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "当务之急的重要任务，就是把这个节目造成的损失赶紧救回来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我知道你，淳于乔的入室弟子，郁董说你很聪明，果然名不虚传。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "总编室人事变动刚宣布，你就知道进来找我私聊，很识时务啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "在这个行业里，无论是经验还是制作能力，我比起淳于乔都是有过之而无不及。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我刚来这公司，团队里很需要一个像你这样对公司情况熟悉的人帮我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "外面那俩是淳于乔的死党，对我误解颇深，可你年轻自由。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "如果你愿意，我可以在总编室给你留一个职务，以后你也可以喊我谢老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好的，谢老师。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢总，刚才没来得及认识，我叫布小谷，是总编室高级制作人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Xie, we did not get to meet earlier; I am Bu Xiaogu, senior producer in the chief editor office.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "好长的名头啊，找我有事啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Quite a long title you have got there; did you need something from me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想听一听您对节目魅力远航的看法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I would like to hear your thoughts on the programme Charming Voyage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "这个节目我大致了解，我的态度就是先放到一边，暂且不管吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have a general sense of that show, and my stance is to set it aside and leave it alone for now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "当务之急的重要任务，就是把这个节目造成的损失赶紧救回来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our most urgent priority right now is recouping the losses caused by that programme.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我知道你，淳于乔的入室弟子，郁董说你很聪明，果然名不虚传。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know who you are, Chun Yuqiao's prized disciple; the chairwoman said you are sharp, and you live up to your reputation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "总编室人事变动刚宣布，你就知道进来找我私聊，很识时务啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right after the leadership change was announced, you knew to come chat with me privately—very sensible of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "在这个行业里，无论是经验还是制作能力，我比起淳于乔都是有过之而无不及。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In this industry, both my experience and production ability match or even surpass Chun Yuqiao's.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我刚来这公司，团队里很需要一个像你这样对公司情况熟悉的人帮我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since I just arrived here, my team badly needs someone familiar with the company like you to assist me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "外面那俩是淳于乔的死党，对我误解颇深，可你年轻自由。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Those two outside are Chun Yuqiao's diehard allies and misunderstand me deeply, whereas you are young and independent.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "如果你愿意，我可以在总编室给你留一个职务，以后你也可以喊我谢老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you are willing, I can save a post for you in the editorial office, and you may call me Teacher Xie.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好的，谢老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, Teacher Xie.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢总，刚才没来得及认识，我叫布小谷，是总编室高级制作人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "好长的名头啊，找我有事啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想听一听您对节目魅力远航的看法。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "这个节目我大致了解，我的态度就是先放到一边，暂且不管吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "当务之急的重要任务，就是把这个节目造成的损失赶紧救回来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我知道你，淳于乔的入室弟子，郁董说你很聪明，果然名不虚传。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "总编室人事变动刚宣布，你就知道进来找我私聊，很识时务啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "在这个行业里，无论是经验还是制作能力，我比起淳于乔都是有过之而无不及。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我刚来这公司，团队里很需要一个像你这样对公司情况熟悉的人帮我。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "外面那俩是淳于乔的死党，对我误解颇深，可你年轻自由。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "如果你愿意，我可以在总编室给你留一个职务，以后你也可以喊我谢老师。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好的，谢老师。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Seeing that Xie Ling plans to shelve Charming Voyage while trying to recruit her away from Kaiwen and Xingzi, Xiaogu smiles politely and leaves with crucial intelligence. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
